Let's not kid ourselves, Mr. Tressler.

1002
00:48:24,985 --> 00:48:27,069
You're in this to ride them up.

1003
00:48:27,571 --> 00:48:29,530
I'm in it to ride them down.

1004
00:48:29,865 --> 00:48:32,908
I take it that we do not have a deal.

1005
00:48:34,411 --> 00:48:38,747
And therein lies our conflict.

1006
00:48:42,169 --> 00:48:43,419
Let me be blunt.

1007
00:48:43,837 --> 00:48:48,299
My bank account is much,
much bigger than yours.

1008
00:48:48,508 --> 00:48:51,343
And my lawyers are much stronger.

1009
00:48:51,678 --> 00:48:54,763
And they will manacle you

1010
00:48:56,016 --> 00:48:57,683
with so many injunctions.

1011
00:48:58,101 --> 00:49:03,105
Until you stand by, hopelessly watching
everything that you own drain away

1012
00:49:03,940 --> 00:49:06,317
in front of your greedy little eyes.

1013
00:49:06,526 --> 00:49:08,819
This isn't the first time I've been threatened.

1014
00:49:10,280 --> 00:49:11,697
And I'm still here.

1015
00:49:11,781 --> 00:49:16,285
It is, however,
the first time you've been threatened by me.

1016
00:49:17,078 --> 00:49:21,499
And if you do anything
to sully my investment,

1017
00:49:21,583 --> 00:49:23,959
the ride down, which you mentioned,

1018
00:49:24,044 --> 00:49:29,006
will be sudden, precipitous,
and measurable on the Richter scale.

1019
00:49:30,800 --> 00:49:32,718
Oops. You shouldn't have done that.

1020
00:49:34,221 --> 00:49:35,763
According to superstition,

1021
00:49:35,972 --> 00:49:38,891
one who uses a doll to enact one's own wrath,

1022
00:49:39,100 --> 00:49:43,562
is likely to bring that very wrath unto himself.

1023
00:49:44,397 --> 00:49:45,898
Isn't that funny?

1024
00:49:46,733 --> 00:49:48,567
And I thought you didn't believe in magic.

1025
00:49:52,364 --> 00:49:54,657
(ALL CLAMORING)

1026
00:49:58,620 --> 00:49:59,703
Do me a favor.

1027
00:49:59,788 --> 00:50:03,874
Visualize your most adventurous
sexual experience.

1028
00:50:03,959 --> 00:50:04,959
Stay out of my head, you perv.

1029
00:50:05,043 --> 00:50:08,754
Well, no, if I stay out of your head,
I'm never gonna get into your pants.

1030
00:50:08,838 --> 00:50:10,881
- Right.
- So let's stick with this exercise.

1031
00:50:10,966 --> 00:50:12,841
- And it helps...
- THADDEUS: Pardon the intrusion.

1032
00:50:12,926 --> 00:50:15,511
