1058
00:51:32,922 --> 00:51:34,423
Is it?

1059
00:51:34,507 --> 00:51:36,258
No. No, I don't see it up there.

1060
00:51:36,343 --> 00:51:40,054
You know, why don't you check
your unnecessary velveteen pocket there?

1061
00:51:41,890 --> 00:51:42,890
Yeah.

1062
